If I fix those two, this one might be fixed too, but it also has `get_args(annotation)` at the end.
If `annotation` is `Annotated[List[int], Meta]`, `get_args(annotation)` returns `(List[int], Meta)`.
`field_annotation_is_scalar(Meta)` will probably be `True`.
